<compatibility>
<note version="9.7" minversion="9.7.0" severity="warning">
This design uses the unified restrict layer format where all restrict objects
reside on layer 41 (Restrict) with a restrictlayers bitset. Older versions
expect separate tRestrict (41) and bRestrict (42) layers and may not display
bottom restrictions correctly.
</note>
